{"4428120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nomad: Last Blade", "steam_appid": 4428120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD NO LONGER BELONGS TO HUMANITY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Raven — a cybernetic samurai marked as an anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your existence has triggered a global retrieval order issued by an advanced artificial intelligence known as Mortiex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Mortiex is not only hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is inside your blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=972 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS HAPPENING?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomous patrol units sweep the remains of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical enforcers eliminate anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signals track movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders are broadcast without emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter strengthens the connection between you and the system hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere within the system, a single command repeats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure the blade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRECISION-DRIVEN COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad: Last Blade delivers fast, technical action built around control and timing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based sword combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect parries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical dash and repositioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-quarters kicks and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth eliminations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive enemy behavior</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights are lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 1v1 duels — or outmaneuver overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT HAPPENED TO HUMANITY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities stand silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infrastructure runs without citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines continue their directives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity did not vanish overnight, It was pushed aside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the population disappeared from the surface — replaced by automated systems and centralized control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everyone is gone, Small groups remain hidden beyond the surveillance grid, living in secrecy, avoiding detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the shadows, humanity survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/9297ae284f0b840cb2e21a786c4e60e8.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/9297ae284f0b840cb2e21a786c4e60e8.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/9297ae284f0b840cb2e21a786c4e60e8.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD NO LONGER BELONGS TO HUMANITY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Raven — a cybernetic samurai marked as an anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your existence has triggered a global retrieval order issued by an advanced artificial intelligence known as Mortiex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Mortiex is not only hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is inside your blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=972 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/463af352e23c7a4eff1ad240c10a4a0a.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS HAPPENING?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomous patrol units sweep the remains of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical enforcers eliminate anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signals track movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders are broadcast without emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter strengthens the connection between you and the system hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere within the system, a single command repeats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure the blade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/01386ae4153e7dced3c680f6b575d933.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRECISION-DRIVEN COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomad: Last Blade delivers fast, technical action built around control and timing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based sword combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect parries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical dash and repositioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-quarters kicks and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth eliminations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive enemy behavior</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-phase boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights are lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 1v1 duels — or outmaneuver overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.poster.avif?t=1779441092\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.webm?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4428120/extras/7f3517e7892f37b3ed9bf59b14414125.mp4?t=1779441092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT HAPPENED TO HUMANITY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities stand silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infrastructure runs without citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines continue their directives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_p